<title>USA: Mego Financial unit files for IPO.</title>
<headline>Mego Financial unit files for IPO.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mego Financial Corp said Friday its Mego Mortgage Corp filed for an initial public offering that would make 20 percent of the subsidiary available to investors.</p>
<p>Mego Financial said the equity offering is expected to raise about $25 to $30 million.</p>
</text>
